      "title": "$Backend_Developer => [PHP | Java | Laravel | Angular | Spring Boot]",
      "description": "Hi there! I'm Pedro Luque 👋\n\nI'm a backend developer specializing in PHP and Laravel, with experience in Vue.js, Python, Java, and Spring Boot. I enjoy building clean, efficient, and maintainable software, and I believe good code should work just as well behind the scenes as it does on the surface.\n\nI'm passionate about technology, programming, and photography. Curiosity has always been one of my biggest strengths. When I come across something I don't know, I see it as an opportunity to learn, experiment, and grow.\n\nI also enjoy exploring new technologies and integrating AI-powered tools into my daily development workflow. From solving complex problems and refactoring code to improving productivity and exploring better solutions, I believe AI is a valuable ally when combined with solid technical knowledge and critical thinking.\n\nBefore becoming a developer, I worked in different industries, where I developed skills that still shape the way I work today: teamwork, adaptability, discipline, and empathy. I believe being a good developer isn't just about writing code. It's also about communicating, collaborating, and understanding the people behind every project.\n\nI'm always looking for ways to improve, whether it's learning a new technology, finding a cleaner solution, or challenging myself with something I've never built before.\n\nAnd when I'm not coding, you'll probably find me behind a camera. 📸\n\nIf you'd like to talk about technology, interesting projects, or just share a virtual coffee ☕, I'd be happy to connect!",
